  "summary": "The Dongfeng eπ 007 (pronounced 'e pi'; also known as Yipai 007, Dongfeng Ace 007 or simply Dongfeng 007), is a battery electric and plug-in hybrid full-size liftback sedan and shooting brake produced by Chinese automobile manufacturer Dongfeng Motor Corporation under the Dongfeng eπ (东风奕派) sub-brand. It is the first product of the eπ sub-brand, and was launched in March 2024. The batteries of the Dongfeng eπ 007 are supplied by the United Auto Battery System (UABS), a joint venture between SAIC and CATL.",
